{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[{"xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","chapter":"Use of first components provided by OUDS","title":"Use your first OUDS components","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"backgroundImage":"ic_component_intro.png","image":"ic_component_intro.png","kind":"hero","estimatedTimeInMinutes":30},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"contentSection":[{"kind":"contentAndMedia","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We will work on a kind of formular using main OUDS components."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Feel free to style and design things as you want."}]}],"mediaPosition":"trailing"}],"title":"Add basic components","stepsSection":[{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-1.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"First, prepare the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":" by adding inside it a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"caption":[],"runtimePreview":null,"media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now, let’s add radio buttons to let the user choose its gender."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The official components are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadio"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":", but the package has also a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioPicker"},{"type":"text","text":" to implement quicky a group of radios."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This component can be replaced by your own."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The radio picker is defined by an array of values to display radio items associated to a tag, i.e. an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":" thing shared through a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Inside a picker the user can select only one value, not zero."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add such picker with three items inside."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.png","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radio picker is alone, it is the time to add below a checkbox. OUDS provides two components: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckbox"},{"type":"text","text":" which is a simple checkbox, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItem"},{"type":"text","text":" which is a checkbox (duh!) with additional texts and icons."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The state of the checkbox is shared through a boolean "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In some cases you may need to use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxIndeterminate"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate"},{"type":"text","text":" if you want a three-states checkbox."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a checkbox item with only two states."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are also components who do not have any behaviors and are here only for visual rendering, for example dividers which can be horizontal or vertical."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A divider is, in the end, a stroke with a color. You will see later, colors in OUDS have two values: a light mode value, and a dark mode value. Here the divider can have a color which can change, or not."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose to add an instance of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.png","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With radio and checkbox, OUDS provides also switch elements (toggles). They can be alone ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":") or with texts ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitchItem"},{"type":"text","text":")."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Just like the checkbox, the switch exposes its state through a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a switch item, it will be used as a trick to force the change of the color scheme for the view for our future operations."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will then be able to see the automatic changes of colors when you switch the color scheme."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Users may need to navigate outside the app, like, for example, opening a website. Thus the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLink"},{"type":"text","text":" component can be integrated. It can be only with a text or also a chevron indicator."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSLink"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app and make it open the iOS documentation OUDS website."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the end, we can also add a button. Button are one of the most used components in an app and bring a lof of the power and the style of the brand."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You can find it with the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton"},{"type":"text","text":". Such button has an appearance changing its colors, and also a style (loading or not)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thanks to the theme, the enabled, disabled, hover, focus or pressed states are managed."}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s add a button with some rules: if checkbox is not checked it is disabled. When tapped, change the style of the button during 5 seconds."}]}],"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.png","media":null}],"anchor":"Add-basic-components"}]},{"anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessments","assessments":[{"choices":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No! The components use the design specifications, i.e. tokens, thanks to the theme, to define the style they must have in all cases."}]}],"isCorrect":false},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No"}]}],"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That is the reason why the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" is so important: it injects the theme as environment variable so that any component can get it to define its style."}]}],"isCorrect":true}],"type":"multiple-choice","title":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does the developer using OUDS component need to manage the look and feel of the components?"}]}],"content":[]}]},{"kind":"callToAction","action":{"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","type":"reference","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","title":"Add more OUDS components","abstract":[{"text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs.","type":"text"}]}],"metadata":{"category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Use your first OUDS components","role":"project"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"},"hierarchy":{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Preparation-of-the-theme","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources","kind":"task"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further"}]}],"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS"]]},"kind":"project","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result","kind":"section","title":"Final result","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding":{"type":"link","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Check Your Understanding"}],"title":"Check Your Understanding"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"section","title":"Add basic components","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding":{"type":"link","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Check Your Understanding"}],"title":"Check Your Understanding"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies":{"abstract":[],"role":"article","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/import-of-the-swift-package-and-choose-its-librairies","kind":"article","title":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app","kind":"section","title":"Basic structure for the app","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Since you have learned how OUDS works with theme, themeable view, components, tuning and view modifiers, it is time now to discover some online resources."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources","kind":"section","title":"More resources","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","kind":"section","title":"Import the Swift Package and the libraries","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}],"role":"overview","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)","kind":"overview","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms."}],"estimatedTime":"10min","role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","kind":"project","title":"Swift Package integration","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","type":"topic"},"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift":{"type":"file","fileName":"Content.swift","highlights":[],"content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","","    var body: some View {","        OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                        radios: genderRadioValues(),","                        placement: .horizontal(false))","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift","fileType":"swift","syntax":"swift"},"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-5.png"}],"alt":"A radio picker, an horizontal divider, a checkbox item and a switch item"},"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-6.png"}],"alt":"A radio picker, an horizontal divider, a checkbox item, a switch item and a link"},"tutorial-discovery-3-6.swift":{"type":"file","fileName":"Content.swift","highlights":[{"line":10},{"line":11},{"line":23},{"line":24},{"line":25},{"line":26}],"content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","    @State var switchToDarkMode: Bool = false","","    @Environment(\\.openURL) var openUrl","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","","            OUDSSwitchItem(\"Switch to dark mode\", isOn: $switchToDarkMode)","","            OUDSLink(text: \"Go to the website\", indicator: .next) {","                openUrl.callAsFunction(URL(string: \"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\")!)","            }","        }.preferredColorScheme(switchToDarkMode ? .dark : .light)","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.swift","fileType":"swift","syntax":"swift"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist","kind":"section","title":"Want to be an artist?","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist","type":"section"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/